> In a small bowl, combine fennel, capers, lemon juice, pars[ley] and olive oil and set aside.
Preheat oven to 400°F. Lay trout on a greased baking sheet.[ Stuff] each fish with slices of red onion, lemon, whole sp[rig]s of pars[ley] and ore[gan]o.[ Drizzle] with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.
Bake 15 to 18 minutes or until fish is firm and flake[y]. Serve with fennel salad.

